        "In ontology" , "Script holds" , "Script reads" , "Inferred" , "Declared" ,
        "In register" , "Deciding" , "Executing" , "Unattributed" , "Attributed" ,
        "Unchecked" , "Checked" .


#################################################################
#  v6.1.0 — the owner's grooming model applied.
#
#  Tested against what was built and found two deviations plus a
#  framework gap:
#
#   1. Epics carried acceptance criteria and NO Definition of Done
#      and NO test cases. The stories were therefore written to
#      satisfy nothing stated at epic level.
#   2. All nine stories were detailed in one pass at v1.109.0,
#      three sprints ahead — not per sprint.
#   3. The framework could not express (2): a RefinementEvent
#      recorded WHEN grooming happened, never WHICH iteration it
#      prepared for. Just-in-time grooming could be performed and
#      never checked.
#
#  Each epic now carries a DoD and a test case exercising its
#  criterion — the target the stories are converted to satisfy.
#################################################################
fw:DoD_EP_Rulings a backlog:DefinitionOfDone ;
    backlog:hasDoDCriterion "All 18 rulings are reachable by query, each naming its enforcing shape, and the reachability gate reports no new unreferenceable class." ;
    backlog:hasDoDCriterion "The objective this epic moves is observed at its new value, by the measurement method that objective declares." ;
    backlog:hasDoDCriterion "No inverse objective is breached: no class added the export does not require, no explanatory paragraph lost." .
fw:EP_Rulings backlog:appliesDefinitionOfDone fw:DoD_EP_Rulings .
fw:TC_EP_Rulings a backlog:TestCase ;
    backlog:exercisesCriterion fw:AC_EP_Rulings ;
    backlog:runsOnData fw:TD_EP_Rulings .
fw:AC_EP_Rulings backlog:coveredByCase fw:TC_EP_Rulings .
fw:TD_EP_Rulings a backlog:TestData ;
    backlog:hasFixtureState "One discipline document with G1 through G18 and the shapes file" .
fw:DoD_EP_CodeTables a backlog:DefinitionOfDone ;
    backlog:hasDoDCriterion "All 23 tables exist as ontology enumerations and no python module holds a classification literal." ;
    backlog:hasDoDCriterion "The objective this epic moves is observed at its new value, by the measurement method that objective declares." ;
    backlog:hasDoDCriterion "No inverse objective is breached: no class added the export does not require, no explanatory paragraph lost." .
