    backlog:hasObservationMethod "Counted over registered CodeTable individuals with tableExported false and hasTableKind Table_Classification. Fourteen classification tables; LAYERS, the quality metrics, STAGE_TYPES, ORDER, CONTAINER_TYPES and SECTIONS have moved. Nine remain. The figure is not comparable to the original baseline of 23 without saying why: that baseline counted every capitalised assignment including twelve operational tables which this release ruled out of scope, and both readings are recorded." .

